---
import { legacyIds } from '../../data/legacy-ids.mjs';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" style="background:#0c0c0c;">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0c0c0c">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>正在打开文章 — 个人商业创造者</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokens.css">
<script is:inline data-astro-rerun>document.documentElement.classList.add('js');</script>
<script is:inline src="/js/site-shell.js" defer></script>
<style>
  body{font-family:'Noto Sans SC','Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-secondary);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:var(--space-24);line-height:var(--lh-body);text-align:center;}
  a{color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  p{font-size:var(--fs-14);}
</style>
<script is:inline define:vars={{ legacyIds }}>
  const raw = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('id');
  const slug = raw ? legacyIds[Number(raw)] : null;
  location.replace(slug ? `/insight/${slug}/` : '/insights/');
</script>
</head>
<body>
  <p>正在打开文章… 如果没有自动跳转，<a href="/insights">回到洞察列表</a>。</p>
</body>
</html>
